@baseUrl = http://localhost:5030/api/Customers
@token = paste-a-development-jwt-here
@customerId = 1

### Get a page of customers
GET {{baseUrl}}?page=1&pageSize=10
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Search customers
GET {{baseUrl}}?search=lee&page=1&pageSize=10
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get one customer
GET {{baseUrl}}/{{customerId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Create a customer
POST {{baseUrl}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Jordan Lee",
  "email": "jordan.lee@example.com",
  "phone": "+1 415 555 0134",
  "dateOfBirth": "1992-08-14",
  "gender": "Other",
  "address": "18 Market Street, San Francisco, CA"
}

### Update a customer
PUT {{baseUrl}}/{{customerId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Jordan Lee",
  "email": "jordan.lee@example.com",
  "phone": "+1 415 555 0168",
  "dateOfBirth": "1992-08-14",
  "gender": "Other",
  "address": "22 Market Street, San Francisco, CA"
}

### Deactivate a customer
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/{{customerId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Reactivate a customer
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/{{customerId}}/activate
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Verify missing-customer behavior
GET {{baseUrl}}/2147483647
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}